From 051084dc1c69a9edcbd2fa43ffa7910610f4212f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: A2Tools-patch <patch@localhost>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 13:03:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Event Timers: the bosses due soon and the Artifact Siege in
 the folded view

Folded, the window showed the next three events only, and no boss. Under
them it now lists the scheduled bosses on now or starting within a time
picked in Settings ("Folded: bosses due within": off, 30 min, 1 h, 2 h,
3 h; 1 h at first), and the world bosses up, in their window or back
within it, the ones up first. The next Artifact Siege stays in the
folded view too, however far off.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TUNxq4V2zBL7bJg3yPJ3oC
